# Certified result CSVs from the St. Louis County Board of Elections.
# 52 MB in total, so they are not committed. fetch.sh re-fetches them and
# derive_roster.py REFUSES to run on a short file -- a truncated CSV returns a
# plausible wrong winner under a clean HTTP 200. See FETCH.md.
csv-*.csv

# Council journals, pulled from civicweb. Re-fetchable from the stable /document/<id> URLs
# recorded in ROSTERS.md; the quotations that matter are transcribed there.
min-*.pdf
min-*.txt
m*.json
meetings-*.json
